                                    <img src="https://ntcceagles.com/sites/default/files/styles/eagles_news_card/public/athletics/articles/IMG_5784-new.jpg.avif?itok=bIIMuBLd" alt="Men&#039;s Soccer" fetchpriority="high">
            </div>
  <div class="eagles-news__card-body">
    <h3 class="eagles-news__card-title">
      <a href="/athletics/story/2026/eagles-clip-colts-kick-out-cancer-day">
                  Eagles Clip Colts on Kick Out Cancer Day
              </a>
    </h3>
          <div class="eagles-news__card-excerpt"><p>Eagles Clip Colts on Kick Out Cancer Day</p><p><span>Mount Pleasant, Texas — The NTCC men's soccer team closed out their slate of 2026 non-conference games in style with a 2-0 victory vs UAC.</span></p><p><span>The Eagles warmed up in pink shirts prior to the game in support of the fight to Kick Out Cancer.</span></p></div>
        <div class="eagles-news__card-meta">
      October 15, 2026      &nbsp;|&nbsp;Men&#039;s Soccer    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      <div class="eagles-news__grid-item"><div class="eagles-news__card">
      <div class="eagles-news__card-image">
                                    <img src="https://ntcceagles.com/sites/default/files/styles/eagles_news_card/public/athletics/articles/1000044805.jpg.avif?itok=UziEnZTh" alt="Men Soccer" loading="lazy">
            </div>
  <div class="eagles-news__card-body">
    <h3 class="eagles-news__card-title">
      <a href="/athletics/story/2026/eagles-jump-over-jaguars">
                  Eagles Jump over Jaguars
              </a>
    </h3>
          <div class="eagles-news__card-excerpt"><p><span><strong>Jacksonville, Texas</strong>&nbsp;— The NTCC men's soccer team went on the road to face the Jacksonville College Jaguars earning a victory with their most complete performance to date, setting up a showdown with top ranked TJC on Friday in Tyler.&nbsp; With the win the Eagles climb into third place in the division.&nbsp; NTCC won in comfortable fashion 4-1 at Jacksonville.</span></p></div>
        <div class="eagles-news__card-meta">
      October 5, 2026      &nbsp;|&nbsp;Men&#039;s Soccer    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      <div class="eagles-news__grid-item"><div class="eagles-news__card">
      <div class="eagles-news__card-image">
                                    <img src="https://ntcceagles.com/sites/default/files/styles/eagles_news_card/public/athletics/articles/Regional%20win%20vs%20Alvin.jpg.avif?itok=IeC_L6gW" alt="Regional Win Vs Alvin" loading="lazy">
            </div>
  <div class="eagles-news__card-body">
    <h3 class="eagles-news__card-title">
      <a href="/athletics/story/2026/northeast-texas-community-college-eagle-baseball-unveils-exciting-fall-2026">
                  Northeast Texas Community College Eagle Baseball Unveils Exciting Fall 2026 Schedule
              </a>
    </h3>
          <div class="eagles-news__card-excerpt"><p><strong>Northeast Texas Community College Eagle Baseball Unveils Exciting Fall 2026 Schedule</strong></p><p>MOUNT PLEASANT, Texas — The Northeast Texas Community College Eagle Baseball program is set for a competitive and action-packed Fall 2026 season, featuring a mix of high-level tournaments, regional matchups, and home contests at NTCC. Head coach and the Eagles will use the fall slate to build chemistry, evaluate talent, and prepare for the spring campaign.</p></div>
        <div class="eagles-news__card-meta">
      October 1, 2026      &nbsp;|&nbsp;Baseball    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
  </div>
